{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 56,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.372276306152344,
        163.96287536621094,
        72.36227416992188
      ],
      "text": "6.2.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.02693176269531,
        399.082763671875,
        89.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "Amoxicillin and co-trimoxazole are the most widely available oral antibiotics for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        89.02693176269531,
        399.07275390625,
        102.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "non-severe pneumonia. The study by Strauss et al suggests higher treatment failure",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        102.02693176269531,
        342.7428283691406,
        115.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "in severe pneumonia with co-trimoxazole as compared to amoxicillin.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        115.02693176269531,
        399.1515808105469,
        128.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "Studies of the duration of amoxicillin therapy are briefly summarized here, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        128.0269317626953,
        399.11260986328125,
        141.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "have been assessed and summarized in a WHO 2003 consultative meeting report",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        141.0269317626953,
        399.1028747558594,
        154.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "[WHO, 2003]. Trials in low-HIV prevalence settings have shown equal effectiveness",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        154.0269317626953,
        396.75286865234375,
        167.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "between short- (3 days) and long- (5 day) duration therapy. The benefits of short-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        167.0269012451172,
        399.09283447265625,
        180.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "term therapy are increased compliance, lower cost, and lower exposure to potential",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        180.0269012451172,
        399.0127868652344,
        193.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "antibiotic side effects. However, shortened courses have not been as well-studied in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        193.0269012451172,
        399.0827941894531,
        206.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "areas of high-HIV prevalence, where a substantially greater burden of severe bacterial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        206.0269012451172,
        399.1029052734375,
        219.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia exists among persons infected with HIV. Prudence indicates that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        219.0269012451172,
        399.0927429199219,
        232.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "shortening treatment to a 3-day course should be studied before being implemented",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        232.0269012451172,
        121.9928970336914,
        245.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "in such settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        256.5455017089844,
        205.30300903320312,
        268.5354919433594
      ],
      "text": "6.2.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        272.2000732421875,
        399.05291748046875,
        285.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "Amoxicillin and co-trimoxazole are widely available. Oral amoxicillin was preferred",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        285.2000732421875,
        396.83282470703125,
        298.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "as first line treatment over co-trimoxazole, because it is effective against both non-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        298.2000732421875,
        399.0527648925781,
        311.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "severe and severe pneumonia in low HIV settings. In high HIV settings, amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        311.2000732421875,
        399.06280517578125,
        324.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "is also preferred because oral co-trimoxazole is recommended for PCP prophylaxis.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        324.2000732421875,
        399.1227722167969,
        337.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "Oral amoxicillin will also be recommended as first line treatment for children with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        337.2000732421875,
        332.0128479003906,
        350.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "severe pneumonia tolerating feeds, and this should simplify uptake.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        350.2000732421875,
        399.0914001464844,
        363.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "Amoxicillin is slightly more expensive than co-trimoxazole. Cost of amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        363.2000732421875,
        399.0828552246094,
        376.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "250 mg is US $0.018 per capsule and US$ 0.022 per dispensable tablet. Cost of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        376.2000732421875,
        333.5028076171875,
        389.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "standard combination co-trimoxazole is US$ 0.013 [UNICEF, 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        399.7477111816406,
        288.2099609375,
        412.93670654296875
      ],
      "text": "6.3\t Antibiotics treatment for severe pneumonia",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        416.3733825683594,
        399.09283447265625,
        429.8634033203125
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children aged 2–59 months with severe pneumonia (chest indrawing) should be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        429.3733825683594,
        375.65155029296875,
        442.8634033203125
      ],
      "text": "treated with oral amoxicillin of at least 40mg/kg/dose twice a day for 5 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        444.77801513671875,
        277.7628173828125,
        458.6980285644531
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        461.0426940917969,
        399.0829162597656,
        474.53271484375
      ],
      "text": "Although this recommendation may be applicable to case management at the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        474.0426940917969,
        399.0827941894531,
        487.53271484375
      ],
      "text": "community or outpatient level, its implementation should be guided by the clinical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        487.0426940917969,
        399.03289794921875,
        500.53271484375
      ],
      "text": "context and setting. It is not applicable in children infected with HIV/AIDS for whom",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        500.0426940917969,
        299.742919921875,
        513.53271484375
      ],
      "text": "clinicians should follow the current HIV specific guidelines.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        518.7119750976562,
        399.11285400390625,
        532.2019653320312
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIn children infected with HIV/AIDS, specific guidelines for treatment of severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        531.7119750976562,
        283.9715881347656,
        545.2019653320312
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia in the context of HIV should be followed.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        547.1165771484375,
        252.91282653808594,
        561.0365600585938
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        574.89990234375,
        231.48292541503906,
        586.8899536132812
      ],
      "text": "6.3.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        590.5545043945312,
        399.1029052734375,
        604.0444946289062
      ],
      "text": "A recent systematic review included five studies that compared oral with injectable",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        603.5545043945312,
        399.1328125,
        617.0444946289062
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics for WHO-defined severe pneumonia [Jabeen et al 2010]. Overall, there is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        616.5545043945312,
        399.1028137207031,
        630.0444946289062
      ],
      "text": "moderate quality evidence that oral therapy with amoxicillin is an effective and safe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.4564971923828,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.58349609375,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "42",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}